  "source": "Vertex average of the BAG 0363100012244160 (Atrium Parkeergarage) footprint; the five BAG pands 0363100012244160, 0363100012074056, 0363100012246583, 0363100012246582, 0363100012246549 and their 3DBAG LoD2.2 shells in one native east/south frame (scripts/landmarks/atrium-zuidas-footprints.json, atrium-zuidas-prepare.ts). The Zuidtoren and the north-east block rebuilt as rounded volumes on their BAG rings with per-floor slab bands; the 1974 block, the lobby and the deck are the 3DBAG roof-plane prisms; facades, slab rhythm and tints from Gemeente Amsterdam panoramas and Wikimedia Commons photographs (scripts/landmarks/atrium-zuidas-inventory.json)."
